This project's own source code is licensed under the MIT License above.

It bundles and distributes @deepseek-ai/dsh and its dependency tree. Those
packages are the property of their respective authors and are distributed under
their own licenses; they are not relicensed by this project. The application
neither modifies nor forks them — it starts dsh through its public APIs and
provides a desktop shell around it.
